flowchart LR
 P[Human intent / AI proposal] --> C[Contract change]
 C --> SC[Schema / reference validation]
 SC --> G[Projection / generation]
 G --> I[Implementation]
 I --> T[Build / runtime validation / tests]
 T --> R{Conformant?}
 R -- No --> F[Structured diagnostics]
 F --> I
 R -- Yes --> E[Scoped evidence]
 E --> A[Approval policy for semantic changes]
